+# Feature Specification: Long-Stay Discount
+
+**Created**: 2026-10-21 | **Status**: Draft
+
+## User Scenarios & Testing
+
+### User Story 1 - Reward longer rentals (P1)
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price; quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+**Acceptance**:
+1. Given a 2-day rental of a 2500 item, the quote total is 5000 (no discount).
+2. Given a 3-day rental of a 2500 item, the quote total is 6750 (7500 less 10%).
+3. Given a 3-day rental, `book` returns a booking with the same reduced total as `quote`.
+4. Given a full price whose 10% discount is not a whole number of cents, the total is rounded to the nearest cent.
+
+### Edge Cases
+- Exactly 3 days qualifies; 2 days does not.
+- Validation and overlap rules are unchanged.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: Full price remains days × dailyPrice.
+- **FR-002**: When the rental lasts 3 days or more, total = 90% of full price, rounded to the nearest integer cent (halves round up).
+- **FR-003**: Under 3 days, total is the full price.
+- **FR-004**: `quote` and `book` apply the same rule (booking total equals quote total).
+
+## Success Criteria
+- SC-001: For any valid rental, `book` total equals `quote` total, and 3+ day totals are 90% of full price to the nearest cent.
+
+## Assumptions
+- Single flat 10% tier; no further tiers, no stacking.
+- "Days" are whole UTC days of the period.
